0..74 Comment "// The circle\'s shape as a signature (the book\'s § 8.1, the point and its"
75..145 Comment "// loop with the two cancellations as laws), and two models of it: the"
146..222 Comment "// presented integers, whose laws are conversion (`Winding`), and the native"
223..297 Comment "// integers, whose laws hold by arithmetic and are owed (`NativeWinding`)."
298..355 Comment "// `loop-winding.gandr` folds the loop\'s words into each."
357..383 Comment "// The presented integers."
